From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: oop23 <ilidans01yt@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 05:04:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Details: data source logos and badges

Next to the TMDb / IMDb logos, the details screen shows the AniList logo
when AniList identified the anime (opens it on anilist.co), an NFO badge
when the info was read from an .nfo file and a 'Your edits' badge when
the info was edited by hand.
